# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: two kinds, each with a key of its own. Public.
format     conformance-held-two
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
kind    first
when    t  one
field   probe.x  x  int
kind    second
when    t  two
field   probe.y  y  int
